    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Draper is proud to present this substantial family home standing proud on C. 1.4 acres with large detached garage unit situated just 2 kms from the hospital, university, Sligo city & within walking distance from the popular local Sudbury school. \nAs you approach this impressive family home up a long shared driveway you get a sense of the scale of the mature private grounds cleverly planted with love & care by its present owner.\nAs you enter inside you are welcomed by a spacious porch & entrance hallway, cosy sitting room with bay window & feature open fireplace, formal dining room with bay window, feature open fireplace & a door leading to the kitchen, well equipped kitchen with extensive range of fitted units, second living room with solid fuel stove & a sliding door to the rear, handy utility room & separate wc.\nOn the first floor are five fine sized bedrooms (three with ensuites) a main house bathroom & large landing. The attic is easily accessed from the landing via a stira stairs and is well floored out and it has a large skylight letting in great natural light.To the rear of the residence is a spacious private paved patio that links well with the house and rear garden & a large detached garage unit that has the potential for many different uses including ,workshop, studio or granny flat accommodation subject to planning. The unit is totally detached & independent from the main residence and has huge potential to be more than what it is currently.\nThe grounds of this impressive residence span to approximately 1.4 acres and are a truly special feature with beautifully planted mature trees & shrubberies providing a haven of peace and an oasis of calm which contribute to a sense of complete seclusion from the world yet only 2km from Sligo. \nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the convenient location & all that this home has to offer.\nJoint agents - E & M Scanlon, Ballymote, Co. Sligo"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance porch - 3m x 1.7m\ntiled flooring\n\nEntrance Hallway - 5.5m x 2.2m\nwooden flooring, staircase with understairs storage\n\nSitting room - 4.6m x 4m\nbay window, feature open fireplace, built in shelving units, coving & centre piece\n\nDining room - 4.5m x 4m\nbay window, feature open fireplace, coving & centre piece, door to kitchen\n\nKitchen - 4.6m x 3.9m\nextensive range of fitted kitchen units, tiled flooring, door to dining room\n\nLiving Room - 4.5m x 3.9m\nsolid fuel stove, sliding door to the patio, tiled flooring, centre piece\n\nUtility Room - 2.4m x 1.5m\nfitted units with sink, tiled flooring, fitted storage unit, door to rear patio & garden\n\nWc - 1.4m x 1.1m\nwc, whb, wall & floor tiling\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding (part 1) - 4.4m x 1m\n\n\nLanding (part 2) - 2.4m x 1.1m\nhotpress\n\nLanding (part 3) - 1.6m x 1.1m\nstira stairs to large floored attic space with skylight\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.6m\nbuilt in wardrobes\n\nEnsuite - 1.9m x 1.3m\nwc, whb, shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 4m x 3.9m\nwash hand basin, built in wardrobe, mountain views\n\nEnsuite - 1.2m x 1.6m\nwc, whb, shower, wall & floor tiling\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.4m\nmountain views\n\nMain house bathroom - 2.3m x 2m\nwc, whb, shower, bath, wall & floor tiling\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.9m x 3.3m\nbuilt in wardrobe, wash hand basin\n\nEnsuite - 1.9m x 1m\nwc, shower, wall & floor tiling\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.5m x 3.6m\nbuilt in wardrobe, wash hand basin, mountain views\n\nLarge detached garage unit - \n\n\nopen garage area - 6m x 4.7m\nplumbing\n\nInternal room with stairs to loft storage area - 4.8m x 4.6m\nstairs to loft storage\n\nInternal room 3 - 6m x 4.7m\ndoor to outside\n\n"
      },
      {
