        "Content": "<ul><li>OFCH</li><li>Double glazed PVC windows</li><li>Large private south facing patio & rear garden</li><li>Large detached garage unit suitable for many different uses</li><li>Elevated large private mature site</li><li>Only 2km from Sligo city near the hospital & University</ul>"
